Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujimaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Councilor Otomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you assess this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be checkmated\Nin seven moves, Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! I'm losing, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Utayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Last month's events were most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your late daughter kept\Na tight command over the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be hard\Nto keep the maids in line without her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter can always be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A castle crumbles\Nonce its central pillar is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a castle is no place\Nfor His Majesty to reside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Utayama Family shall be abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please reconsider, Councilor Otomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Last month's disturbance\Nwas the work of that wretched phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I couldn't foresee it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Preventing the unforeseeable\Nfrom occurring is your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it was your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower them slowly! Be gentle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a humble medicine seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in for another scolding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you insisted\Non carrying them all at once, Kume.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You agreed too, Tome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough fighting, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Repairing the lanterns already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ooku has strict rules\Nabout fire prevention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it's because\Na woman burned to death long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold your tongue around outsiders!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the big secret about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask a professional to paper them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to your duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you lurking around here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You already got rid\Nof the mononoke last month!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. One of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}some passions linger,\Neven after they are slain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up, one and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How about one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're mouse talismans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They ensure fertility and safe childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A foreign princess who bought one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,was blessed\Nwith five sons and five daughters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,MONONOKE THE MOVIE:\NCHAPTER II - THE ASHES OF RAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Look out for fire!\N-Look out for fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look! It's Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's on her way to perform night work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.44,0:04:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect\Nfrom His Majesty's nighttime companion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But it must be tough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The concubines summoned for night work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all shoulder the fate of their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Their family?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever bears a child
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,will be the mother\Nof His Majesty's heir, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Their family will\Nimmediately rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Families, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lady Botan!\N-Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you both resting at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!\N-We just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ooku relies on the fire patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you overlook a potential fire source,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty foo\Nwill be vulnerable to the blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're sorry!\N-We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lady Botan is pretty too!\N-Oh, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, Tokita?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tis I, Councilor Fujimaki!\NForgive the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo,\Nthere is something we must discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not for the ears\Nof subordinates, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay him no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It concerns the princess who was born\Nlast month to His Majesty's consort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to appoint a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The consort has indicated\Nshe would like to raise the child herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A guardian should be chosen\Nfrom among the concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But the consort wishes--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Yukiko is not His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,taking family names into consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps Katsunuma would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Katsunuma, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well! The Katsunuma Family it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's your move.\N-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Any thoughts on what you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Such important matters are the domain\Nof you esteemed councilors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian selection can become a spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If no male heir is born,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the princess will marry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and assume the role of the next consort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her guardian will then become the mother\Nof His Majesty without giving birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives her tremendous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Left unattended,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,even the smallest spark becomes a blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is maintaining the ruling order\Nof the past 150 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That will in turn protect His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right in every respect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-That reminds me, Tokita.\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,About your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She seems to receive{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,great favor from His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,/Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We are most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki and Lady Botan\Nare both beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But with that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the one most likely\Nto give birth to the next heir{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,ls Lady Fuki from the Tokita Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She enjoys His Majesty's exclusive favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Botan is from the Otomo Family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They hold great sway within the Ooku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and most of all,\Nshe's Councilor Otomo's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Family names don't matter/
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter who the mother is,\Nthe heir is the heir.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether she's a merchant's daughter\Nor even a farmer's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,she wins if she gives birth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how the Ooku works?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My own daughter, Botan,\Ncould learn a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkmate in five moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Astounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected,\NI'm no match for you, Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Lord Tokita?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to visit with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait here until the appointed time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He had no pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mizorogi family are an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about a special duty\Nto protect the Water Goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, we don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What an enviable position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneak in again, and it's your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tsuyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder you didn't come when I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're shorthanded,\Nso I was asked to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki, Madam Suikoin is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's His Majesty's mother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll speak later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki acts like\Nall the other concubines these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a year ago,\Nwe were fetching water together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,/It's His Majesty\Nwhose feelings have bloomed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We therefore believe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that Lady Matsu of the Katsunuma Family\Nwill be a suitable guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly ask for your acceptance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about the consort?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The role of a princess's guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,has traditionally been given to a family\Nthat has long served His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Katsunuma Family is a fitting choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You humble me with your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is to be made\Nof the consort's feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her first child after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine she probably wants\Nto raise the child herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's akin to kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only hope it doesn't bring her pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Such impertinence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you don't trust my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply wonder\Nwhat the consort and His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Parents can't help\Nbut feel for their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got some nerve saying that\Nafter she stole His Majesty away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what could\Na poor draper's daughter know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because she's a bit attractive...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For that reason, I suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that we seek His Majesty's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much\Nwe debate among ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,some things are beyond our authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That will not be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty depends on us\Nto settle trivial matters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so that he may focus on his duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not the role of the Ooku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing such a matter to his attention
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Matsu shall be appointed guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else wish to be heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the passing\Nof Madam Utayama last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we must decide who will manage the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The candidates proposed in advance are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Matsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and Lady Take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Of those candidates, Lady Botan\Nhas long assisted Madam Utayama
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and has ties to various lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe she is the best candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Lady Botan shall be\Nthe next administrator of the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly ask for your acceptance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly accept the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Madam Utayama's passing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:13:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are many\Nwho are uncertain about the Ooku's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We must recommit to our duties\Nas maids of the Ooku
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and devote ourselves to the rules\Nwe are sworn to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In particular, we must reaffirm\Nthe rules governing night work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,which have been neglected lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The first rule
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is that conversation with His Majesty\Nduring night work is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Written correspondence is also taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The second rule
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the consort and the concubines\Nshall alternate performing night work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No individual may perform night work\Nfor two consecutive nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overstepping your bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is the one who chooses\Nhis night work companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the administrator\Ncan interfere with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The rule is in place\Nto ensure that an heir is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It has always been deemed a taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What if His Majesty\Nbestowed favor on one woman
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and she could not bear children?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty's bloodline would be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't ignore His Majesty's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, the night before that,\Nand the night before that too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty chose me for night work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-What of it?\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely he hasn't told you\Nto return again the next night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, conversation is taboo\Nduring night work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place, it was His Majesty\Nwho chose the new administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That means His Majesty\Nagrees with Lady Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to defy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, all you care about\Nis family names!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're merely jealous of the favor\NHis Majesty has bestowed on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I only...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone call for the court physician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,GOLD COIN
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Gentaku! It's Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect her to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been quite vexing for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki's condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be morning sickness?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the favor from His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure His Majesty will be pleased!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:16:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The thought of that vulgar woman\Nmixing with His Majesty's bloodline...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it... taking Form?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My pass is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That pass was given to you\Nby Madam Utayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no longer valid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a guard of the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't allow you\Nto enter without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It hides fast too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The men shall investigate this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You all must pry no further.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget this ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Councilor Fujimaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared me for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sparks are already...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Tokita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki has fainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She recovered her senses immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you\Nin a while either, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard whispers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that you've been playing shogi\Nwith Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You must rest for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,would it not be wise to leave the Ooku?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A concubine is bound for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving the Ooku is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After observing last month's events,\Nyou surely understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's exactly why!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The grudge haunting the Ooku
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that curses all the maids to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about your safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-And?\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I flee from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,what happens then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Father's appointment as a samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and your advancement in the ranks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,are both due to the favor\NI receive from His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to give that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting we starve\Nin that shabby row house again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Tokita Family will gain power."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"We will rule the land!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who sent me here to achieve that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I turn tail and run now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,why did I come here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,our goal is truly within grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer have anything to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki, are you pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.44,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? In the grand chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite a development.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To think someone would burn in the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's that too,\Nbut the bigger problem is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Tokita's daughter Fuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If she happens to give birth to a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,conflict over succession is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the Katsunuma Family relies\Non being the princess's guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,your position will also be threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But surely no one would accept\Nthe child of a draper's daughter as heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's the opposite.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll receive support from those\Ndissatisfied with the ruling order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,has become a spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should consult Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He must not hear of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki giving birth is something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he hasn't foreseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what happened to Utayama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fires that begin within the Ooku\Nmust be extinguished within the Ooku!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Left unattended,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,even the smallest spark becomes a blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let us leave this matter\Nto my daughter Matsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not aggravate things further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Handle it quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you faced any difficulties\Nsince Madam Utayama's passing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A young official scribe such as yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,must be a target of envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're ever in need,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you may approach me at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By asking my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,most things can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You humble me with your concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but my duties keep me occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ls maintaining the ruling order\Nof the past 150 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That and service to His Majesty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever forget that mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Choju.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you haven't forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the day you were appointed Matron.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only due\Nto the Katsunuma Family's endorsement
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.72,0:23:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that I am able to spend my days\Nserving His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.92,0:23:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To the night chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Men aren't allowed in the Ooku!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to lose your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell by sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a mononoke present.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A passion that burns humans alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,turning even their bones\Nand marrow to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an idea what it may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:23:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get out of here\Nbefore there's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.16,0:24:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.28,0:24:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware... of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A mononoke ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are saying\Nit's a curse left by Lady Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a guard of the Ooku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.40,0:24:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,tremble at such nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.20,0:24:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lady Fuki gives birth to the heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.64,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Matsu's appointment as guardian\Nwill have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.00,0:24:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:25:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.64,0:25:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.04,0:25:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm simply going to check for mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need water?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.96,0:25:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:26:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Look out for fire!\N-Look out for fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.56,0:26:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.20,0:26:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.60,0:26:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.12,0:27:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tome, look!\N-Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.28,0:27:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.28,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone! Come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.60,0:27:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My flesh is seared!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-She's hot!\N-She's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Get back!\N-Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.84,0:28:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.44,0:28:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Flames that move in swarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the work of
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.32,0:28:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have identified... its Form.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.28,0:28:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Another mononoke ?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere embers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.20,0:28:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Embers?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.28,0:29:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantoms just now\Nwere Hinezumi children.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Their mother is elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.80,0:29:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the suspicious man who was\Nreported in the Ooku this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi is an ayakashi who won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.12,0:29:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,until it burns everything to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,men can never enter the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we allow men in this easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ooku's rules are mere words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.88,0:29:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't slay the source of the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,before long...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Did you hear me?\N-The Ooku will go up in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the weapons you carry
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.28,0:29:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,will be of no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.32,0:29:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A mononoke can only be slain
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.48,0:29:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,with this Sacred Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.28,0:29:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we shall borrow it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.44,0:29:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sakashita.\N-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,\Nonly we can wield the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing it requires certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.68,0:30:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Form, Truth, and Reason.\N-This thing's h-heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Present those three elements,\Nand the sword can be drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.64,0:30:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the mononoke can be slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is the way things appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason is that which smolders in the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The true nature of the passions\Nthat burn people to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.28,0:30:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.16,0:30:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby request
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that you tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Passions that burn people to ashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Palace guards, seize him at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This man was carrying a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.64,0:30:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I let him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.60,0:30:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.56,0:30:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the pass he received\Nfrom Madam Utayama
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,when he slew the mononoke last month!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't use this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:30:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.52,0:31:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan,\Nplease settle this one peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this man did save\Nthe Ooku once!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.16,0:31:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the crime\Nof mistakenly letting him pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will forgive you this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I won't do so again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.36,0:31:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful for your mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be thankful to Sakashita.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.92,0:31:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.16,0:31:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,never show your face here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.68,0:31:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely happened to be passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.68,0:31:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you even sneak in from?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.16,0:31:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.24,0:31:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd cover\Nfor the Medicine Seller, Master Sakashita.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just figured we'll need\Nhis skills to slay the mononoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.60,0:32:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, Lady Botan told me\Nnever to show my face here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She is still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not accustomed to these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.56,0:32:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Accustomed... to what things?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Crises involving fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.64,0:32:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire starts in the Ooku by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Be it humans
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.48,0:32:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or mononoke ,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.16,0:32:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there is always a cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As I suspected,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you know what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.48,0:32:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.68,0:32:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It merely brought back memories\Nof what happened to Lady Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.68,0:32:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Lady Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.48,0:32:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the ghost in the grand chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.64,0:32:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.20,0:32:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on fire patrol knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.24,0:32:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When we patrol at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.16,0:32:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,people often see a woman\Nwith a lamp in the grand chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's no ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.60,0:32:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Suzu was a concubine 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.80,0:33:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She became pregnant,\Nbut it didn't go well,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.96,0:33:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and one day she perished in a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.52,0:33:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the fire did not spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but Lady Suzu fell victim,\Nby chance, to the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.72,0:33:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,in the grand chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.28,0:33:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The last person to see Lady Suzu...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If ] had called out to her at that moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.92,0:33:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Lady Suzu was kindhearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.56,0:33:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She would never become a mononoke
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.04,0:33:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that kills others.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At times, such kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.32,0:33:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,can become a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.68,0:33:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,mononoke too possess Truth and Reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Their feelings have a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.44,0:33:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi was originally\Na guardian mouse deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:33:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It resides{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.52,0:34:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,wherever parents wish for safe childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.44,0:34:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,where is the mononoke now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it may go unseen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it is somewhere in the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I have\Na favor to ask of the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.88,0:34:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All manner of misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.36,0:34:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now's our chance.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm busy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Choju?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.00,0:34:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that it was the work of a mononoke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.92,0:34:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A mononoke ...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.64,0:34:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's merely a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.40,0:34:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.04,0:35:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This water... is tastier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.52,0:35:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was freshly drawn this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.64,0:35:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.24,0:35:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that you call for me\Nas your opponent, Councilor Otomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Does playing shogi bore you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every piece has its role.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.96,0:35:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Although they can be promoted,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,a pawn can never become a rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.32,0:35:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor can a rook ever betray the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.84,0:35:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the game of shogi,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there are no foolish subordinates,\Nnor scheming lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,nor fires that undo\Nall that has come before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.52,0:35:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,These are leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.24,0:35:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on your own this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Purify
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.68,0:36:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cleanse
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.32,0:36:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you not drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.76,0:36:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,By the will of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.20,0:36:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-This was in Madam Utayama's room.\N-Protect us{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,At the spot where Choju died.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.76,0:36:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It likely contained poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.04,0:36:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I gave some to the goldfish,\Nthey died immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't Choju killed by a mononoke ?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not concern yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.24,0:36:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,with why Choju died.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.24,0:36:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it was you she intended to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.72,0:36:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A witness saw Choju\Napproaching your room last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.72,0:36:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you bring me here to mock me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.32,0:36:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that trait of yours that I dislike.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.76,0:37:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who the mother is,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.28,0:37:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the heir is the heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.64,0:37:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Ooku's administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.52,0:37:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a duty to defend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've given you this warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.68,0:37:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you fail to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,because you only think of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never given any thought\Nto the future of the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.84,0:37:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, an heir
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is merely a tool\Nfor advancement, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.04,0:37:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who remains bitter\Nover never being called for night work
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,is you, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.24,0:37:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that satisfy you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These scales will tell us\Nthe mononoke's location?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.76,0:37:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it may go unseen...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.32,0:37:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,this sound will be our guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.76,0:37:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How mysterious!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.48,0:37:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So”?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.24,0:38:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found\Nthe Hinezumi thing, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless the mononoke makes a move,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the scales will not ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.52,0:38:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.72,0:38:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.08,0:38:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That child...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.52,0:38:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"That child"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.64,0:38:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.96,0:38:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a deep-seated grudge is lit ablaze,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.00,0:38:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it will not subside on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.88,0:38:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.08,0:38:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.40,0:38:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go do your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.24,0:38:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.08,0:38:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.36,0:38:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.08,0:39:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This miraculous elixir
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,has been passed down\Nby generations of court physicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.48,0:39:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now then...\N-Doctor Gentaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.04,0:39:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.56,0:39:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.24,0:39:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.16,0:39:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where is your mother?\N-What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping... you could tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.12,0:39:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Lady Fuki safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.68,0:39:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I hear Lady Suzu's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.48,0:39:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.12,0:40:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.48,0:40:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.80,0:40:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Gentaku tried to poison Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.72,0:40:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.08,0:40:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-What did you do to the mononoke ?!\N-Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.20,0:40:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.48,0:40:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Unwanted children\Nhave existed in every era!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely did as I was ordered!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordered by whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The sparks of conflict\Nmust be extinguished!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.68,0:40:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.00,0:40:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations,\Nthat has been the court physician's duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.68,0:40:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.40,0:40:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you abort Lady Suzu's\Nunborn child too?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely prepared the potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-You bastard!\N-How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.68,0:40:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.16,0:40:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Suzu was a kind soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.68,0:40:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.48,0:41:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You all... don't know either?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.32,0:41:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,her child from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.16,0:41:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have identified... its Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.84,0:41:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.00,0:41:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.08,0:41:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules don't matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-...when it comes to mononoke ?\N-She's hot to the touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.56,0:41:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a palace guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.40,0:41:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who can save\Nthe Ooku from the mononoke
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.36,0:41:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is him, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.72,0:42:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I should allow him to trespass?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.72,0:42:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the mononoke\Npossesses Lady Fuki's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.32,0:42:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we cannot stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.00,0:42:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter when or how far,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.00,0:42:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we have traveled\Nto where mononoke have appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.00,0:42:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and slayed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the fate of those of us\Nwho carry the Sacred Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.04,0:42:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have guarded the Nanatsu Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.12,0:42:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,for 30 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.04,0:42:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Sakashita, care only
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.44,0:42:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,about protecting the Ooku!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.40,0:42:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.88,0:42:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Heed my words of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.80,0:42:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you lend me your ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.12,0:42:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have its Reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.80,0:42:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can draw my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.12,0:42:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Lady Fuki
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.96,0:42:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and the child she carries.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.12,0:42:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your punishment is on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:42:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.76,0:43:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,of all the Ooku residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.04,0:43:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I gathered as many as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.68,0:43:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.88,0:43:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you need all these mouse ornaments?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.36,0:43:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They are stand-ins.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.28,0:43:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.88,0:43:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have the mononoke\Nleave Lady Fuki's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.12,0:43:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,According to tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.88,0:43:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,mice are considered\Nguardian deities of childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.00,0:43:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.92,0:43:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there are places where they must dwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.16,0:43:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.32,0:43:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,These won't burn, will they?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only borrowed them, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki and Lady Suzu\Nmay bear some similarities.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.20,0:43:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.80,0:43:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It would explain why\Nthe mononoke is focused on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps explain why the Mother Hinezumi
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.36,0:43:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.12,0:44:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.16,0:44:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.72,0:44:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father is waiting\Nin the grand chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.56,0:44:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.04,0:44:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.08,0:44:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that uchikake ?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.00,0:44:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind him, Lady Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here as punishment\Nfor fighting with a merchant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.24,0:44:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a rather hot-blooded man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.56,0:44:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You may raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.80,0:44:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakashita?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is it?\N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take better care of your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.48,0:45:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have\Nkept you waiting, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.88,0:45:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.36,0:45:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.00,0:45:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, the Saijo Family
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.44,0:45:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,no longer worry about our next meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.60,0:45:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.00,0:45:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the favor His Majesty\Nhas bestowed on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.36,0:45:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.12,0:45:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.20,0:45:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You were only able to enter the Ooku...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...because of Councilor Otomo's\Nintroduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.64,0:45:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never forgotten my debt\Nto Councilor Otomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.68,0:45:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.28,0:45:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...does not care for...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.00,0:45:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...sparks that lead to conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.04,0:45:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your child is...\N-...unwelcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.96,0:45:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo\Nhas commanded me to abort the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.08,0:46:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo\Nwould never say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.88,0:46:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why we, his subordinates...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.76,0:46:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...must act on our own
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.56,0:46:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to extinguish the sparks of conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.00,0:46:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.00,0:46:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to have underestimated things.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.04,0:46:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.44,0:46:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.64,0:46:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.28,0:46:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sudo! Asanuma! Bring the burn ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.20,0:46:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.16,0:46:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:47:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These were merely Hinezumi children.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.00,0:47:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's more to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.48,0:47:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The mononoke
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.52,0:47:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,won't stop until it is slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to draw your sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.88,0:47:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I must locate Hinezumi's Reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.88,0:47:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nthe root of its urge to burn the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.68,0:47:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.64,0:47:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.64,0:47:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Saburomaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.28,0:47:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange rumor has spread about Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.20,0:47:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-You mean her pregnancy?\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.36,0:47:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They say she asked His Majesty\Nto make her the administrator of the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.40,0:47:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They found a letter\Nasking for his recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.56,0:47:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki violated a taboo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.44,0:47:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.72,0:47:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In the night chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.48,0:47:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone found it while cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.08,0:48:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would dare\Nwrite a letter to His Majesty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.52,0:48:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who raised\Nthe issue, Lady Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.60,0:48:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Correspondence or conversation\Nduring night work is taboo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be going out of your way\Nto protect Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.32,0:48:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You allowed that strange man to enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.96,0:48:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you even overlook the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.64,0:48:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's remarkable\Nhow kindhearted you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As the administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.72,0:48:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ooku is under my supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm merely showing concern\Nfor Councilor Otomo's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.08,0:48:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the one\Nwho's misunderstood, Lady Botan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.24,0:48:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.24,0:48:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave Lady Fuki's punishment to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.64,0:48:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan... the administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.32,0:48:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father will pay a visit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.76,0:49:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Father will?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.60,0:49:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.84,0:49:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.64,0:49:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you're aware
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.48,0:49:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that I served Lady Suzu long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.72,0:49:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.32,0:49:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing\Nthat I've never been able to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.32,0:49:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way Lady Suzu looked
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.28,0:49:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,on the day she perished in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.32,0:49:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Having lost her child,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.36,0:49:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,her face looked as if her soul
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.40,0:49:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,had been stripped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.68,0:49:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At this moment, Lady Fuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,your face looks just like hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.32,0:49:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean Lady Suzu\Nholds a grudge against the Ooku?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.64,0:49:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Her fire
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.68,0:49:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is cataclysmic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.04,0:49:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataclysmic?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.32,0:49:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can find the Mother Hinezumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.08,0:50:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Tokita!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.04,0:50:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakashita.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.72,0:50:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.64,0:50:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.60,0:50:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brow has grown furrowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.40,0:50:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.72,0:50:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You have something to tell me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.92,0:50:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.08,0:50:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo has summoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.20,0:50:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.24,0:50:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.56,0:50:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.24,0:51:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.96,0:51:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They happened to be in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.44,0:51:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.64,0:51:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have news\Nabout Tokita's daughter, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.72,0:51:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter was found yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.92,0:51:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter asked His Majesty\Nto recommend a new administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.32,0:51:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was signed by Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.80,0:51:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard everything from Katsunuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.80,0:51:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.48,0:51:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.48,0:51:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it to be a forgery\Ndesigned to implicate Lady Fuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Councilor Otomo, if I may speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.80,0:51:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.92,0:51:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.80,0:51:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because Lady Fuki\Nis carrying a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.16,0:51:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Court Physician Gentaku
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.84,0:51:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,tried to abort it using poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.80,0:51:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Matron who died earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.24,0:51:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,was attempting the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.16,0:51:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means this sudden rumor too...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.76,0:52:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.28,0:52:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I fail to see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.84,0:52:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A child who could become\Nthe heir was nearly killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.20,0:52:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.52,0:52:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That will never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.92,0:52:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.52,0:52:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.36,0:52:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ooku is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.28,0:52:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, the mother of the heir
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.04,0:52:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,has been from a councilor's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.64,0:52:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A family without power of their own
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.56,0:52:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,would only be used\Nby other ambitious lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.36,0:52:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and the nation would plunge into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.72,0:53:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But Father, you always told me\Nto protect the heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.68,0:53:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An heir born to the Tokita Family
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.00,0:53:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,would be the spark that sets Japan aflame.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.64,0:53:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Extinguishing that spark
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is the righteous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.92,0:53:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Lady Matsu really
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.44,0:53:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,ask me to wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.92,0:53:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This realm needs those\Nwho can see the bigger picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.00,0:53:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who will take the initiative\Nand act for the Ooku's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.08,0:53:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokita's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.96,0:53:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,broke the rules of the Ooku
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.28,0:53:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and passed a letter to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.92,0:53:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Botan?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.68,0:53:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-I command you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.64,0:53:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend the Ooku!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.64,0:53:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A witness discovered the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.56,0:53:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As the administrator, you must punish her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.04,0:53:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.72,0:54:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you call that defending the Ooku?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.00,0:54:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The conspirators who did your bidding\Nhave tarnished the Ooku,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.76,0:54:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are merely looking the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.36,0:54:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.64,0:54:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.88,0:54:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.68,0:54:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who let you in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.84,0:54:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The passion of the concubine Suzu,\Nfrom 20 years ago, has become...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.72,0:54:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-A mononoke !\N- mononoke ?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.36,0:54:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.76,0:54:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to slay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.12,0:54:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.40,0:54:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's happening?!\N-Ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Down below?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.00,0:54:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.48,0:55:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.72,0:55:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Matsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.84,0:55:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how many lives
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,have you people stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.96,0:55:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As the head of the Otomo Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.76,0:55:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done everything for the Ooku's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.92,0:55:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.00,0:55:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.80,0:55:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But its voice is crying out,\N"Unforgivable."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.04,0:55:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi burning itself is unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.96,0:56:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time and time again, I've extinguished\Nthe sparks that could consume the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.20,0:56:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.64,0:56:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you're the one\Nwho forced Lady Suzu to abort her child!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.80,0:56:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reason is at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.12,0:56:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know nothing about any "Suzu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.00,0:56:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I, myself, have never told anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.96,0:56:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to abort their child!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.92,0:56:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi is crying out, "Unforgivable."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.84,0:56:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.64,0:56:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Loyal citizens merely took action
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.60,0:56:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to prevent conflict over succession!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.00,0:56:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi!\NWhat is it that you can't forgive?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.52,0:56:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you consume yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.12,0:57:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.04,0:57:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.08,0:57:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to drink this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.84,0:57:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I drink it, the Saijo Family
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.32,0:57:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,will have served Councilor Otomo loyally.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can be proud of that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.68,0:57:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.56,0:57:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.16,0:57:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same pain as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.20,0:57:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, even greater pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.48,0:57:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect the Saijo Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine Seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.68,0:58:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.20,0:58:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.48,0:58:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns! Help, it burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.76,0:58:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Botan! You must save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.84,0:58:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die, what will become of the Ooku?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.64,0:58:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the nation itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.04,0:58:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You aborted your own child.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.16,0:58:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.12,0:58:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And the regret consumed\Nyour body in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.80,0:58:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if our lives end here,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.08,0:58:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there are plenty of leaders\Nwho could take our place!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.56,0:58:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The one worthy of protection
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.00,0:58:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is the child about to be born!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.84,0:59:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let your child...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.92,0:59:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Lady Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.76,0:59:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let your child go?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.92,0:59:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.88,0:59:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.04,0:59:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-...done the...\N-...done the...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.96,0:59:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have done the unforgivable."”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.96,0:59:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's... how you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.96,0:59:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.44,0:59:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,has been revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.68,0:59:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Form, Truth, and Reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.48,0:59:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,With these three elements in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.40,0:59:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will release
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.04,1:00:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.28,1:00:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Release!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.48,1:01:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinezumi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.16,1:01:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after becoming a mononoke ,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.36,1:01:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,your passion seeks to reduce you to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.24,1:01:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of Kon,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.64,1:01:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the eight swords of Yin and Yang...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.80,1:01:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall purify you and lay you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.88,1:01:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,mononoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.28,1:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.96,1:01:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.16,1:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.56,1:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.32,1:02:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether the child is wanted or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.72,1:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.60,1:02:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I will inform Councilor Otomo myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.36,1:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuki, at this rate,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,your life will be in danger too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.72,1:02:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I too
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.32,1:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,wish for the safety of my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.32,1:03:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.20,1:03:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lord Medicine Seller.\N-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.32,1:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I ever thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.52,1:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,for saving my sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.16,1:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely slew a mononoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.88,1:03:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is all that luggage?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.84,1:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.36,1:03:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the same ornaments he burned!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.44,1:03:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope these can make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.08,1:03:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be delighted!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.00,1:04:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're willing to hand guardianship\Nof the child to us, the Fujimaki Family?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.56,1:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As the new chief councilor,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.48,1:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are you not in need of allies?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.20,1:04:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tokita Family shall be under my wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.28,1:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Councilor Otomo has passed away,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.92,1:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Suikoin has sole rule over the Ooku.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.40,1:04:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if an heir were to be born...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.92,1:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.24,1:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to raise\Nthe child yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.96,1:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.12,1:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.08,1:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you losing again?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.44,1:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.52,1:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.72,1:04:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got you cornered.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.04,1:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.08,1:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good--\N-Good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.60,1:04:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.44,1:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! I give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.24,1:05:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogi is boring anyway!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.32,1:05:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be closing the gate soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.68,1:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kume said she'd like to see the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.44,1:05:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.16,1:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess since\NCouncilor Otomo forbade them...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.32,1:05:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the fire patrol after all!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.48,1:05:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to monitor the fireworks too!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.00,1:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.16,1:05:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Botan!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.72,1:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all resting at once?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.36,1:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!\N-We just...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.16,1:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too long, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.64,1:05:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive... Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.04,1:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you planning\Nto sneak into the Ooku again?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.24,1:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.16,1:05:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pray...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.36,1:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't have to use this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.64,1:06:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whoa, they're so pretty!\N-Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.52,1:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.52,1:06:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.76,1:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.72,1:07:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This fire
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.72,1:07:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is for mourning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.08,1:07:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,PART THREE
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.08,1:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,TO BE CONTINUED\NIN "THE CURSE OF THE SERPENT"
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.56,1:14:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,THE ASHES OF RAGE
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.52,1:14:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitle translation by: Brad Plumb
